Bottom line
- If you want the easiest, most enjoyable experience next week with good weather and services, pick Joshua Tree (first choice) or Pinnacles (second choice). If you’d like cool, crowd‑light coastal hikes, Redwood is also excellent—just note the Dec 1–3 parkway maintenance closure to vehicles. Yosemite Valley will be lovely, but plan around the high‑country and weekday trail closures. Avoid Death Valley/Lassen/SEKI high country unless you confirm exactly what’s open the day you go.
