2025-12-01 10:06:32,091 - agent.executor - INFO -     Tool result: [{"paper_id":"41203087","title":"Large language models accurately extract aortic information from abdominal imaging reports in a large, real-world database.","authors":"Flanagan CP; Gerstley LD; Okuhn S; McLenon M; Lancaster EM; Hull MM; Bulbule MS; Sivamurthy N; Chang RW","abstract":"Maintaining robust surveillance programs for abdominal aortic aneurysms (AAA) is important, but these programs are expensive and labor-intensive, typically requiring manual data review by trained healthcare professionals. Studies have shown that natural language processing (NLP) software can assist in these functions, but each task-specific algorithm requires human-directed training before use. Our objective was to evaluate the use of a large language model (LLM) to extract AAA related data using generalized artificial intelligence, negating the need for task-based training.","doi":"10.1016/j.jvs.2025.10.044","published_date":"2025-01-01T00:00:00","pdf_url":"","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/412030...
