Tool `Hugging Face:get-paper-info` with Parameter {'arxiv_id': '1706.03762'} on Hugging Face succeeded. Result (summarized from 58954 tokens): Title: Attention Is All You Need
ArXiv page: https://huggingface.co/papers/1706.03762
Authors: Ashish Vaswani; Noam Shazeer; Niki Parmar; Jakob Uszkoreit; Llion Jones; Aidan N. Gomez; Lukasz Kaiser; Illia Polosukhin

Core contribution and results
- Introduces the Transformer: an encoder–decoder architecture based solely on attention mechanisms, removing recurrence and convolutions.
- Benefits: higher quality, far better parallelization, and significantly reduced training time vs. recurrent/convolutional sequence models with attention.
- Machine translation benchmarks:
  - WMT14 En→De: 28.4 BLEU, exceeding prior best single and ensemble models by >2 BLEU.
  - WMT14 En→Fr: 41.8 BLEU (single model) after 3.5 days on 8 GPUs—much lower training cost than prior SOTA.
- Generalization: successfully applied to English constituency parsing with both large and limited training data.

