How this synthesis was built
- Pulled recent arXiv results (multi-round Paper Search) to identify convergent themes across multimodal reasoning (Video-R2, Video-CoM), agentic/world-model learning (WMAct), and test-time RL (ThetaEvolve), plus generation and efficiency work (AnyTalker, VGT, Price of Progress).
- Cross-checked trends with PubMed reviews to anchor “what’s deployable now” in healthcare and to surface the practical constraints (validation, bias, calibration).
- Prioritized papers that contributed new diagnostics/benchmarks, demonstrated measurable gains with small data or lower cost, and released code/datasets to support replicability.
