  Title: Visual Generation Tuning
  Authors: Jiahao Guo; Sinan Du; Jingfeng Yao; Wenyu Liu; Bo Li; Haoxiang Cao; Kun Gai; Chun Yuan; Kai Wu; Xinggang Wang
  Date: 2025-11-28 | Category: cs.CV
  Objective: Unlock latent visual generation capabilities in pretrained Vision-Language Models (VLMs) intended for multimodal understanding.
  Method: Proposes VGT (Visual Generation Tuning), aligning semantic encoders of VLMs with pixel decoder latents via VGT-AE, removing dependence on pixel-level VAEs designed for diffusion transformers. Enables efficient autoregressive modeling in continuous space with reduced alignment costs and faster convergence (~20× speedup).
  Results:
