  - Retrospective WES/RNA-seq comparison (2019–2023) in melanoma vs thyroid cancer. BRAF inhibitors have 50–70% response in melanoma but less in thyroid cancer. Introduces a MAPK Activation Score (MPAS) based on Z-score normalized/log-transformed expression of 10 MAPK-associated genes; registry outcomes used to correlate expression with clinical response, suggesting downstream pathway activation may explain differential efficacy.

