  - Drug: Exarafenib is a novel type 2 pan-RAF inhibitor that binds RAF regardless of isoform or dimerization state.
  - Efficacy: Robust antitumor activity in multiple preclinical models of Class II/III BRAF-mutant tumors; initial clinical signals of activity in Class II BRAF-mutant NSCLC.
