  - Analysis: 2025-11-02 21:50Z; Speed 536 km/s; Type C
  - Link: https://webtools.ccmc.gsfc.nasa.gov/DONKI/view/CME/42318/-1

- ID: 2025-11-02T16:36:00-CME-001
