Endpoint: GET /user/repos
- Summary: List repositories for the authenticated user.
- Description: Returns repositories the authenticated user has explicit permission to access (:read, :write, or :admin). Includes repos the user owns, collaborates on, or can access via organization membership (including team access).
- Tags: repos
- OperationId: repos/list-for-authenticated-user
- Method docs: https://docs.github.com/rest/repos/repos#list-repositories-for-the-authenticated-user

Query parameters
- visibility (string; enum: all, public, private; default: all): Filter by repo visibility.
- affiliation (string; default: owner,collaborator,organization_member): CSV values:
  - owner: repos owned by the user
  - collaborator: repos where the user is a collaborator
  - organization_member: repos accessible via org membership (includes all team repos)
- type (string; enum: all, owner, public, private, member; default: all): Filter by type. Cannot be used with visibility or affiliation (using together returns 422).
- sort (string; enum: created, updated, pushed, full_name; default: full_name): Sort property.
- direction (string; enum: asc, desc): Sort order. Default asc when sort=full_name, else desc.
- per_page (integer; default: 30; max: 100): Results per page. See pagination docs.
- page (integer; default: 1): Page number. See pagination docs.
- since (string date-time, ISO 8601): Only repos updated after this timestamp.
- before (string date-time, ISO 8601): Only repos updated before this timestamp.

Response
- 200 OK: application/json; array of Repository objects.

